#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:89
#: 5e5362a556e64899953810803a6d1277 a033dc492c0e4e1b89a964212cbf3326
#: a3cd67f5fa2144dca822b284fb7a9bce e18a328769d94bea9ec50d5e82064a32
#: efc9e265ecb54e3198c0ad612728feaf
msgid ""
"Grid: This allows you to draw a polygon (right click) and automatically "
"create waypoints over the selected area. Note that it does not do \"island "
"detection\", which means if you have a big polygon and a little one inside "
"of that, the little one will not be excluded from the big one (see `this "
"<http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__ for more). "
"Also, in the case of any polygon that partially doubles backs on itself "
"(like the letter U), the open area in the center will be included as part of"
" the flyover."
msgstr ""
"Grid（网格）：允许你绘制一个多边形（右键点击），并在选定区域上自动生成航点。注意它不做\"岛屿检测\"，即如果一个大多边形内部还有一个小多边形，小多边形不会从大多边形中排除（更多内容见"
" `此处 "
"<http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__）。此外，对于部分自我折回的多边形（如字母"
" U 形），中间的开放区域也会被包含在飞越范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:100
#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:105
#: 4ac6d2ff38e94d53bad0660a240e4ab5 7349b1212800473cba6526d17423b4a9
#: 9e92fc818a22457d8588caa87037d552 afa8526116e74b14a4fe67a2fe61fb34
#: d3478faaddff4f9996b80acd291c566b
msgid ""
"The altitude change between waypoints is normally a linear ramp of target "
"altitude as the vehicle progresses unless the altitude starts below 25m "
"above home to prevent slow climbs potentially close to home. This value can "
"be controlled with the :ref:`CLIMB_SLOPE_HGT<CLIMB_SLOPE_HGT>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"航点之间的高度变化通常是目标高度随飞行进度线性渐变，但起始高度低于 home 上方 25m 时除外，以防止可能在 home 附近发生缓慢爬升。该值可通过"
" :ref:`CLIMB_SLOPE_HGT<CLIMB_SLOPE_HGT>` 参数控制。"

